        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Continue our global expansion: We intend to continue to expand beyond the more than 100 countries (as of December 31, 2025) where we currently sell locally‑certified products by increasing our presence in the core EV markets, and penetrating rapidly developing markets such as APAC and Eastern Europe.",
