        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-149722",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design and manufacture our products in‑house across our factories.",
        "start_character": 25959,
        "end_character": 26028
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-149722",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-149722-7526fbb6554786c6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-149722",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design and manufacture our products in‑house across our leased factories located in Barcelona, Spain (Zona Franca) which has an estimated production capacity of approximately 389 thousand chargers per year, Arlington, Texas which has an estimated production capacity of approximately 241 thousand chargers per year, Nürnberg, Germany (Lauf an der Pegnitz) which has an estimated production capacity of approximately 56 thousand chargers per year and approximately 10,600 thousand of connectivity components per year and Tangier, Morocco where we produce components for the charger's production.",
