        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We remain committed to increasing our worldwide presence and believe the EV market will continue to grow as the market continues to mature with new EV offerings, continuous roll-out of charging infrastructure and stricter emissions target in specific regions with the aim of reducing CO2.",
